[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: VeloSim Verilator gap work packages
UID: VS-VERILATOR-PLAN

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-01
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Pin the comparison baseline and qualify existing capabilities
STATEMENT: >>>
A reproducible baseline report names every tested source hash, distinct pass/fail/skip counts, line/branch scope and known oracle differences. No broad requirement is closed from focused passes.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-01, P0, relative scope M. This is a work package, not evidence of implemented support or approved product requirement closure. Dependencies: none. Existing product IDs: VS-QUAL-001, VS-RTL-ASSOCIATIVE-001, VS-RTL-QUEUE-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/2. Detailed scope, tasks, evidence limits and status index are in the linked planning documents. Library evaluation: LIB-05, LIB-09, LIB-15. Source/API research is complete; dependency selection, compatibility and behavioral qualification remain open.
<<<
