[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-02
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Implement the timed scheduler and region semantics
STATEMENT: >>>
Directed traces cover #0 before NBA, NBA reactivation, simultaneous clocks, sampled delayed addresses, overflow, exhausted budgets and rollback. Host input changes at a future tick cannot leak into earlier queued events.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-02, P0, relative scope XL. This is a work package, not evidence of implemented support or approved product requirement closure. Dependencies: WP-01, WP-20. Existing product IDs: VS-RTL-TIME-001, VS-RTL-EVENT-TRANSPORT-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/3. Detailed scope, tasks, evidence limits and status index are in the linked planning documents. Library evaluation: LIB-07, LIB-12, LIB-17. Source/API research is complete; dependency selection, compatibility and behavioral qualification remain open.
<<<
