[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-03
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Lower suspended HDL processes, delays, waits and fork control
STATEMENT: >>>
Same-original-file comparisons exercise producer/consumer handshakes, internal oscillators, delay quantization, wait rearming, nested suspension and fork cancellation; minimized ordering cases have independent expected traces.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-03, P0, relative scope XL. This is a work package, not evidence of implemented support or approved product requirement closure. Dependencies: WP-02. Existing product IDs: VS-RTL-TIME-001, VS-RTL-PROC-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/4. Detailed scope, tasks, evidence limits and status index are in the linked planning documents. Library evaluation: LIB-01, LIB-07. Source/API research is complete; dependency selection, compatibility and behavioral qualification remain open.
<<<
