[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-05
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Expand functions and tasks beyond pure zero-time inlining
STATEMENT: >>>
Tests distinguish pass-by-value from ref aliasing, automatic from static lifetime, early return and recursive limits; timed calls resume correctly and existing pure-call cases stay compatible.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-05, P1, relative scope XL. This is a work package, not evidence of implemented support or approved product requirement closure. Dependencies: WP-03, WP-04. Existing product IDs: VS-RTL-FUNC-001, VS-RTL-TASK-001, VS-RTL-FLOW-001, VS-RTL-PARAM-001, VS-RTL-PROC-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/6. Detailed scope, tasks, evidence limits and status index are in the linked planning documents. Library evaluation: LIB-01, LIB-19. Source/API research is complete; dependency selection, compatibility and behavioral qualification remain open.
