[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-07
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Broaden expressions, numeric types and packed word sizes
STATEMENT: >>>
Independent BigInteger/bit-string oracles and multiple frontends cover widths255/256/257/512/1024, X/Z, signed overflow and casts; ABI changes are versioned and old hosts fail clearly.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-07, P1, relative scope L. This is a work package, not evidence of implemented support or approved product requirement closure. Dependencies: WP-01. Existing product IDs: VS-RTL-WORD-256-001, VS-RTL-INTEGER-001, VS-RTL-TYPE-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/8. Detailed scope, tasks, evidence limits and status index are in the linked planning documents. Library evaluation: LIB-02, LIB-03, LIB-05, LIB-15. Source/API research is complete; dependency selection, compatibility and behavioral qualification remain open.
<<<
